{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120891","id":3985367387,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ti-Fb","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120891","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120891.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120891.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120891","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120891/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120891/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120891/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/292239db6b54fc1601dcda7ceba4888b960ecff7","number":120891,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Fix attribute access falsely counting as local usage","user":{"login":"mattigu","id":47303532,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MzAzNTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47303532?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu","html_url":"https://github.com/mattigu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #120846\r\n- _Member edit: Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113624_\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nExample from the issue\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nfunc foo(bar: Test) -> void:\r\n\tvar member := bar.member\r\n\t# Commenting the following line causes `member` to trigger the UNUSED_VARIABLE warning.\r\n\tprint(bar.member)  # Same behavior as `print(member)`, as far as the warning is concerned.\r\n\r\nclass Test extends RefCounted:\r\n\tvar member := 0\r\n```\r\nThe problem is in how `parse_attribute` calls `parse_identifier`.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/549d1846bdfc0886b4696a1a76f15206364f69b0/modules/gdscript/gdscript_parser.cpp#L3456\r\n\r\n`parse_identifier` doesn't know it's parsing a part of subscript chain like `bar.member`. In the code below, `parse_identifier` finds `member` and increments it's usage. This is not correct for assignment like `var member := bar.member` since the part `bar.member` is not real usage.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/549d1846bdfc0886b4696a1a76f15206364f69b0/modules/gdscript/gdscript_parser.cpp#L2872-L2881\r\n\r\nI fixed this by decrementing the usage in `parse_attribute` right after calling `parse_identifier`. The original issue only mentioned the problem with normal variables, but it also appeared in other cases which I fixed. I also added regression tests.\r\n\r\nAn alternative solution would be to make a duplicate parse_identifier() without the unnecessary logic for the attribute case. \r\n```gdscript\r\n case SuiteNode::Local::CONSTANT: \r\n \tidentifier->source = IdentifierNode::LOCAL_CONSTANT; \r\n \tidentifier->constant_source = declaration.constant; \r\n \tdeclaration.constant->usages++; \r\n```\r\nI'm not sure if setting any of the fields above is needed for attributes.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","upda